abstract: >-
  Unrefereed mathematical proofs, counterexamples, and partial results in
  combinatorics, number theory, graph theory, and discrete geometry.
  Includes Lean 4 formalizations and reproducible verification code.
  Each result states its formalization scope, sources, and attribution.
